# Preview hosts

Shared contract: `preview/contract.js` + `beebMenu.js` + FastSID (`$FC20` → vendored jsSID).

| | Node `preview/node` | Browser `preview/browser` |
|--|---------------------|---------------------------|
| Who | CLI, create goldens/tests | Disc Creator + Test Disc modal |
| Disc | Path (buffer → temp SSD) | In-memory `Uint8Array` |
| Session | `jsbeeb/machine-session` | Local `MachineSession` (no fs/sharp) |
| ROMs | jsbeeb defaults | `/jsbeeb/` via `sync:jsbeeb` |
| Screenshots | session (+ sharp path) | canvas crop → PNG |

## Rules

- `createSsd({ preview: true })` is invalid alone — supply `preview.stage` from the right host.
- Default model for `*FREE` / DFS catalogue shots: **`B1770`** (Acorn 1770 DFS). Not `B-DFS1.2`.
- Capture order for disc info shot: boot BASIC → `*CAT` → `*FREE` → PNG → then Shift+Break to SIDPLAY menu.
- Keep Node and browser capture APIs aligned (`menuPng`, `freePng`, `tunes[].wav`).
- Live/Test Disc uses browser session + realtime paint; turbo capture uses accelerated `runFor`.

```js
// CLI / tests
import { previewSsdStage } from "beebsidtools-src-create/preview/node";

// App
import { previewSsdStage } from "beebsidtools-src-create/preview/browser";
```
